# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MOASYS-Vault — Music ignore list (template)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Silences warnings you've decided to live with. Copy to
# ignored/<drive>/music.yaml (e.g. ignored/server/music.yaml), uncomment what
# you need, and re-run. The real file is gitignored.
#
# Names match exactly at their level, in any category, case-insensitively. An
# entry silences EVERY warning at or below it — scan and Plex. To turn off one
# kind of warning everywhere, use `checks:` in rules/music.yaml instead.
#
# Full reference: docs/CONFIG.md → "ignored/<drive>/<type>.yaml"
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# A whole category folder
# folders:
#   - Other Music

# A whole artist
# artists:
#   - Various Artists

# One album — bare, or with its artist when the name isn't distinctive
# albums:
#   - Kid A
#   - Pink Floyd/The Wall

# One track — must name its album
# songs:
#   - The Wall/01 - In the Flesh.flac
